<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Anyway, the fire's out and everyone's gone home."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see... Who on earth..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE>, I'm going to make the rounds and thank everyone."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"The rounds?"</STYLE><PG>
"I had a lot of people helping put it out, so I should thank them properly."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's right. Even between close friends, there's courtesy. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But it's late. Wouldn't tomorrow do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well... there are things I want to ask around about right away, too. 
{PAUSE ""}
So I'm heading out."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Kotaro<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hm?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You be careful. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It may be a long night."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah, I know."
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
